{"id":71261,"date":"2026-10-28T16:48:18","date_gmt":"2026-10-28T16:48:18","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/?post_type=ajde_events&#038;p=71261"},"modified":"2026-10-28T17:51:21","modified_gmt":"2026-10-28T16:51:21","slug":"backyard-ultra-ansiao","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/backyard-ultra-ansiao\/","title":{"rendered":"Backyard Ultra Ansi\u00e3o 2027"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\"><h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Backyard Ultra Ansi\u00e3o 2027<\/span><\/h2><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">O <strong>Backyard Ultra Ansi\u00e3o 2027<\/strong> (3\u00aa edi\u00e7\u00e3o) realiza-se a partir do dia <strong>20 de mar\u00e7o de 2027<\/strong> (s\u00e1bado), com a primeira partida marcada para as <strong>09:00<\/strong> no <strong>Parque Empresarial do Campor\u00eas (Centro de Neg\u00f3cios de Ansi\u00e3o)<\/strong>, em Ch\u00e3o de Couce, no concelho de <strong>Ansi\u00e3o<\/strong>, distrito de <strong>Leiria<\/strong>. Esta competi\u00e7\u00e3o oficial do circuito mundial <strong>Backyard Ultra<\/strong> ostenta o estatuto de <strong>Bronze Ticket<\/strong>, dando ao vencedor acesso direto \u00e0 disputa pela sele\u00e7\u00e3o nacional portuguesa.<\/p><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Inspirado no lend\u00e1rio formato criado por Lazarus Lake, o evento desafia-te a percorrer um circuito circular de exatamente <strong>6.706 metros (4,167 milhas)<\/strong> e <strong>80m D+<\/strong> de desn\u00edvel positivo a cada hora, nos trilhos e caminhos rurais da regi\u00e3o de <strong>Ansi\u00e3o<\/strong> e da Serra de Sic\u00f3. A cada 60 minutos em ponto, ao toque do sino, inicia-se uma nova volta (perfazendo 100 milhas \/ 160,9 km a cada 24 horas de prova): o tempo que sobrar no final de cada loop serve para recupera\u00e7\u00e3o e assist\u00eancia na arena, vencendo exclusivamente o \u00faltimo atleta capaz de concluir uma volta final em solit\u00e1rio dentro da hora regulamentar.<\/p><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">A organiza\u00e7\u00e3o est\u00e1 a cargo da equipa <strong>100 G\u00e1s Trail Team<\/strong>, com o apoio institucional do <strong>Munic\u00edpio de Ansi\u00e3o<\/strong>. A prova garante zona de assist\u00eancia dedicada no Centro de Neg\u00f3cios do Campor\u00eas (permitindo at\u00e9 2 elementos de apoio por participante), abastecimento l\u00edquido desde a primeira volta e refor\u00e7o s\u00f3lido a partir das 14:30, dorsal personalizado e t-shirt oficial do evento. Consulta o calend\u00e1rio nacional de provas de <a href=\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/trail\/\" style=\"color: #C4B5FD; text-decoration: underline;\">Trail Running em Portugal<\/a>.<\/p><\/div><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\"><h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2><ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\"><li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Data & Hor\u00e1rio<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">20 de Mar\u00e7o de 2027 \u00e0s 09:00<\/span><\/li><li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Local, Concelho & Distrito<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">Parque Empresarial do Campor\u00eas (Centro de Neg\u00f3cios de Ansi\u00e3o), Ansi\u00e3o, Leiria<\/span><\/li><li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; fo